  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Eye Bolt with Self-Tapping Thread offers a practical and versatile solution for enhancing the functionality of 3D-printed models. Their unique design—featuring a circular loop and a threaded shaft—makes them ideal for decorative, integrating mechanical, and structural capabilities into printed objects."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Applications"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Hanging and Display: Attach to models like ornaments, keychains, or wall decor for easy suspension."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Moving Parts: Use as pivots or connectors for dynamic assemblies like hinges or linked components."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Reinforcement: Strengthen load-bearing models or secure them to walls or ceilings."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Interactive Prototypes: Enhance toys, educational kits, or functional prototypes with mechanical connections."
    }
  ],
